 be a problem. The init order during play error and the (doesn't work at all) are two different issues. The above PR will address the init order PIE error.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827377098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827397346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119391#issuecomment-4827397346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119391","id":4827397346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH7w84g","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T21:07:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T23:17:06Z","body":"@AThousandShips any way we can spin this off into a research ticket for hapticfeedback constants and android 13 behavior around the following.\nSystem haptic/vibration is disabled in their Android settings\nDevice-specific ROM quirks (Samsung One UI sometimes handles haptics differently)\nApp's cannot ignore system haptic settings.... so turning it on in godot edtior will still respect android globals for android 13+\n\nI have a strong feeling this is actually the case for the (it doesn't work for me) reports","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827397346/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827454203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119391#issuecomment-4827454203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119391","id":4827454203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH70a-w","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T21:31:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T21:31:07Z","body":"> The above fix will resolve the init error for touch devices that do not have haptic feedback support while testing with PIE ...\n\num.. what's the full form of PIE ?\n\n> any way we can spin this off into a research ticket for hapticfeedback constants and API 23 behavior around the following.\n\nWhy API 23 behaviour? Godot only supports API 24+ devices.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827454203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827703940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119391#issuecomment-4827703940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119391","id":4827703940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH8DqhA","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T23:14:14Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T23:22:36Z","body":"> > The above fix will resolve the init error for touch devices that do not have haptic feedback support while testing with PIE ...\n> \n> um.. what's the full form of PIE ?\n> \n> > any way we can spin this off into a research ticket for hapticfeedback constants and API 23 behavior around the following.\n> \n> Why API 23 behaviour? Godot only supports API 24+ devices.\n\num.. what's the full form of PIE ?\nPIE ... \"Play in editor\" \n\nWhy API 23 behaviour? Godot only supports API 24+ devices. (CONTEXT_CLICK)_haptics constant was added\nThis is not godot related its for information about where the change took place in android constants.... \nThe key point is that since Android 13 (API 33), apps can't force haptic feedback on when the user has it disabled system-wide - which is likely what's happening to the \"doesn't work\" reporters.\n\nI'll update the context above in my comment to be less confusing. \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827703940/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827723605","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119391#issuecomment-4827723605","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119391","id":4827723605,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH8E3VQ","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-28T23:22:42Z","updated_at":"2026-06-28T23:22:42Z","body":"> The key point is that since Android 13 (API 33), apps can't force haptic feedback on when the user has it disabled system-wide - which is likely what's happening to the \"doesn't work\" reporters.\n\nYeah, I suspect that too. It's probably disabled in the device settings (or an issue with the device).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4827723605/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4981372271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119391#issuecomment-4981372271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119391","id":4981372271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKOm1bw","user":{"login":"SwampN3rd","id":34669618,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NjY5NjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34669618?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwampN3rd","html_url":"https://github.com/SwampN3rd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwampN3rd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwampN3rd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwampN3rd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SwampN3rd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.